; Type helpers: what a helper cannot be or contain, where it cannot be
; declared, a parent that is not a helper for the same type, helpers for
; classes (not supported yet), a helper's name used as a type or for its
; members, instance methods through the type name, missing bodies, and
; writing a helper's property (not supported yet).
; RUN: not %p3 --mode=objfpc -ferror-limit=0 -c %S/Inputs/typehelpers/errors.pas -o %t.o 2>&1 | FileCheck %s
; CHECK: errors.pas:6:22: error: 'TC' is not a type helper
; CHECK: errors.pas:13:14: error: the methods of a type helper cannot be 'virtual', 'override' or 'abstract'
; CHECK: errors.pas:15:23: error: 'TH' is a helper for 'integer', not for 'byte'
; CHECK: errors.pas:16:25: error: type helpers for classes and interfaces are not supported yet
; CHECK: errors.pas:19:5: error: type helpers cannot be declared in a class or record
; CHECK: errors.pas:22:6: error: type helper 'TH' cannot be used as a type
; CHECK: errors.pas:26:3: error: type helper 'TL' must be declared at program or unit level
; CHECK: errors.pas:9:15: error: method 'TH.NoBody' is declared but never implemented
; CHECK: errors.pas:46:8: error: the members of type helper 'TH' are used through 'integer'
; CHECK: errors.pas:47:16: error: only static class methods, class variables and constants of a type helper can be used through a type name; 'Twice' is a function
; CHECK: errors.pas:48:16: error: no member named 'Nope' in type helper 'TH'
; CHECK: errors.pas:49:5: error: writing a property of a type helper is not supported yet
; CHECK: errors.pas:50:10: error: '.' applied to a value of type 'integer', which is not a record
; CHECK-NOT: error:

; RUN: not %p3 --mode=objfpc -ferror-limit=0 -c %S/Inputs/typehelpers/parse.pas -o %t.o 2>&1 | FileCheck --check-prefix=PARSE %s
; PARSE: parse.pas:6:5: error: a type helper cannot contain fields
; PARSE: parse.pas:9:5: error: constructors and destructors in type helpers are not supported yet
; PARSE: parse.pas:12:20: error: the class methods of a record must be 'static'
; PARSE: parse.pas:15:11: error: typed constants in type helpers are not supported yet
; PARSE: parse.pas:18:5: error: a type helper cannot contain fields
; PARSE: parse.pas:21:15: error: type helpers need --mode=objfpc and {$modeswitch typehelpers}
; PARSE-NOT: error:

; Not in tp mode:
; RUN: not %p3 --mode=tp -c %S/Inputs/typehelpers/parse.pas -o %t.o 2>&1 | FileCheck --check-prefix=TP %s
; TP: parse.pas:5:13: error: type helpers need --mode=objfpc and {$modeswitch typehelpers}
